            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit if it is **underground**.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield more than 9&quot; from all enemy units. Then, set up the other units that were set up **underground** with it (if any) wholly within 6&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
