            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">**Heal (D3)** each friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** unit on the battlefield. Once this ability has been used, this terrain feature cannot use the &apos;Molten Blessing&apos; abiity for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
